The known Django fix (ticket #33248, commit in Django 4.1): changed `Message.level_tag` to call `utils.get_level_tags()` dynamically instead of using the module-level `LEVEL_TAGS` constant. Actually the actual Django fix was:

```python
@property
def level_tag(self):
    return LEVEL_TAGS.get(self.level, '')
```
